Package: frostcenter
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: G Sriram <gsriram2403@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec, polkitd | policykit-1
Homepage: https://github.com/gsriram24/FrostCenter
Description: MSI laptop fan control and thermal monitoring for Linux
 FrostCenter is a modern GTK3 application for monitoring and controlling
 fan curves, temperature thresholds, and battery health on MSI laptops
 via direct ACPI Embedded Controller (EC) port I/O (/dev/port).
